### Use VS Code's REST Client extension, or the PowerShell commands in docs/LOCAL_CLIENTS.md.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Alona branding and upload limits (no model call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/alona/public-config

### Michael branding and upload limits (no model call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/michael-lipkin/public-config

### Alona chat (requires configured provider credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/alona/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Suggest a savory dinner with tomatoes and eggs. Answer in English."}

### Michael chat (requires configured provider credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/michael-lipkin/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Suggest a savory dinner with tomatoes and eggs. Answer in English."}
